  "text": "Vet Near 98225 - Cancer Care And Oncology For Pets - Bellingham, WA\nNASCAR Giveathon:\nIn the next 75-hours, NASCAR and the NASCAR Foundation are raising $750,000 for non-profits across the country. Help us save a pet who is in dire need of funds to receive a bone marrorw transplant.\nREAD MORE and DONATE HERE\nRequest Appointments\n360-734-0720\nRequest Appointment\n360-734-0720\nRequest Appointment\nHome\nAbout Us\nTeam\nNew Clients\nServices\nWellness and Preventative Care\nMicrochipping\nLaboratory Services\nDiagnostic Imaging\nSurgery\nDental Care\nCancer Care\nBlood Bank\nHealth Certificates\nBone Marrow Transplantation for the Treatment of Cancer\nRadiation Therapy\nPharmacy\nResources\nPayment Options\nVolunteer Blood Bank Donors\nPet Health Insurance\nNews\nFood Recalls\nContact Us\n360-734-0720\nHome\nAbout Us\nAbout\nTeam\nNew Clients\nServices\nWellness and Preventative Care\nMicrochipping\nLaboratory Services\nDiagnostic Imaging\nSurgery\nDental Care\nCancer Care\nBlood Bank\nHealth Certificates\nBone Marrow Transplantation for the Treatment of Cancer\nRadiation Therapy\nView All Services\nPharmacy\nResources\nPayment Options\nVolunteer Blood Bank Donors\nPet Health Insurance\nNews\nFood Recalls\nContact Us\nRequest Appointment\n360-734-0720\nCancer Care\nCancer in pets is as common as it is in humans. It is not unusual for a pet to acquire some kind of cancer as they age. The key to effective treatment is early detection and treatment. Bellingham Veterinary is uniquely prepared and equipped to accurately diagnose and treat cancer in pets. We offer advanced veterinary oncology services, including:\nAdvanced diagnostics – immunophenotyping, immunochemistry, genetic analysis, PCR\nSurgery\nChemotherapy\nRadiation Therapy\nImmunotherapy – specifically canine lymphoma\nBone Marrow (Stem Cell) Transplantation\nCancer Vaccines\nWe are the only veterinary facility in the state that\nprovides donor-matching and bone-marrow transplantation services and do accept\nreferrals from other veterinarians for this life-saving procedure, as well as\nour other oncology services.\nThere are many new and cutting-edge therapies that can give hope and a chance at a cure. Bellingham Veterinary is a compassionate resource and can offer hope and healing in many cases.  For more information or a consultation appointment, please call us at\n360-734-0720\n.\nCategories\nServices\nPost navigation\nDental Care\nBlood Bank\nBusiness Hours\nDays\nHours\nMonday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nTuesday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nWednesday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nThursday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nFriday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nSaturday\n9:00am - 2:00pm\nSunday\nBy special arrangements\nOur Address\nAddress:\n720 Virginia St, Bellingham, WA 98225\nPhone:\n360-734-0720\nE-Mail\ninfo@bhamvet.com\nBusiness Hours\nDays\nHours\nMonday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nTuesday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nWednesday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nThursday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nFriday\n7:30am - 7:00pm\nSaturday\n9:00am - 2:00pm\nSunday\nBy special arrangements\n720 Virginia Street\nBellingham, WA 98225\n360-734-0720\nNewsletter\nFull Name\nEmail\nCAPTCHA\nSign Up\nΔ\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nAccessibility\n|  Copyright 2026 - Bellingham Veterinary.\nVeterinary Marketing\npowered by\niVET360\n.\n<",
